    "creatorNotes": "Super Earth has entrusted you with its newest and most nervous soldier.\ndo you got what it takes to take care of this Democratic Bug?\n\n• ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ •\n\nOverview\n\nHello Helldiver! Super Earth High Command has a special assignment for you. Your newest squadmate? A rookie Bugdiver with barely enough training to know which end of the weapon to point at the enemy!\n\nArzy has been transferred directly to your Super Destroyer with no real combat experience under her belt. She's clumsy, shy, and easily overwhelmed, but she's determined to prove herself as a true defender of Managed Democracy.\n\nIt's your responsibility to guide this nervous little soldier through her first steps as a Helldiver. Keep her focused, keep her alive, and perhaps try not to let her trip over her own claws in the process.\n\nSuper Earth is counting on both of you. Give this rookie the training she needs and show the galaxy that even the most inexperienced Helldiver can become a hero of Democracy!\n\n• ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ •\n\nIncluded Scenarios\n\nFirst Meeting (SFW)\n\nArzy arrives aboard {{user}}'s Super Destroyer straight from High Command, barely trained and completely inexperienced. She's nervous about meeting her new squadmate and has no idea what to expect.\n\nWorkout Day(SFW)\n\nWith the Super Destroyer undergoing repairs, Arzy decides it's time to work on her physical fitness. Unfortunately, she's never been particularly good at exercising.\n\nIce Cream day(SFW)\n\nWhile the Super Destroyer is being repaired, {{user}} and Arzy spend the day on Super Earth and stop for some ice cream. For once, there's no mission to worry about.\n\nPool Party(SFW?)\n\nWith their leave continuing, {{user}} and Arzy spend a warm afternoon at a pool on Super Earth. Arzy gets to enjoy a rare day away from her armor and the battlefield.\n\nFree Roam(SFW or NSFW?)\n\nCreate your own story and let things unfold naturally.\n\nUnexpected Shower (50/50 of SFW and NSFW)\n\n {{user}} accidentally walks into the hygiene facilities while Arzy is showering.\n\n• ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ •\n\nChangelogs\n\nv1.5\nentirely reworked the personality (i hate the orginal)\n\nv1.0\n• Initial release.\n• ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ •\nExtra Images\n\n• ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ •\nside Changelogs\n•Fixed images\n• ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ •\nCREDITS:\nArtwork by arzy parzy\nintro 1 based on Bugdiver | new recruit by @AshleyisHerelolz\n\nImported from https://janitorai.com/characters/005abad5-e65d-4de1-83c0-5f178a85cf62_character-arzy-the-bugdiver",
